00 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            国宝「彦根城（ひこねじょう）」とひこにゃんの見どころは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 現存十二天守の一つで、三重三階の美しい天守や玄宮園（大名庭園）が見どころ。毎日城内で登場する人気マスコット『ひこにゃん』のパフォーマンスが定番です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            重要伝統的建造物群保存地区「近江八幡の八幡堀・水郷めぐり」とは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 豊臣秀次が開いた城下町で、白壁土蔵が続く八幡堀を舟で巡る風情ある手漕ぎ舟観光や、名物『バームクーヘン（ラ コリーナ近江八幡）』が人気です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            本場で食べる「近江牛（おうみぎゅう）」の名店は？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 彦根城下町の『千成亭』や近江八幡の『毛利志満（もりしま）』などで、老舗ならではの熟成近江牛すき焼き・ステーキが楽しめます。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">関連記事ナビ</span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">🗺️ あわせて読みたい！滋賀県＆周辺エリアの厳選宿ガイド</h3>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4\">\n    <!-- 同一都道府県エリア特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-amber-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>📍</span> 滋賀県のエリア別・後悔回避宿特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/autumn-kansai-shiga-lake-biwa-matsutake-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】滋賀 琵琶湖絶景＆A5近江牛すき焼き・松茸松花堂会席のおごと温泉旅館特集！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">大津・おごと温泉</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/biwako-resort-hotel-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】琵琶湖リゾートホテルおすすめ特集｜レイクビュー絶景＆オールインクルーシブ！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">大津・琵琶湖</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/kusatsu-otsu-ishiyamadera-shigaraki-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】草津・大津・信楽おすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">草津市・大津市南部・甲賀市信楽町（草津駅前・石山寺・瀬田唐橋・信楽陶芸の森）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/nagahama-kurokabe-makino-lake-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】長浜・奥琵琶湖おすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">長浜市・高島市マキノ町（長浜城・黒壁スクエア・長浜港・竹生島・奥琵琶湖・マキノメタセコイア並木）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 近隣・隣接都道府県の人気特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-orange-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-orange-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>🚗</span> 周遊・隣接エリアのおすすめ特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/fukui-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【福井県】【2026年最新】福井県おすすめホテル・温泉旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">福井県全域（あわら・三国・福井市・永平寺・敦賀・勝山）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/gifu-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【岐阜県】【2026年最新】岐阜おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">岐阜県全域（下呂温泉・飛騨高山・白川郷・奥飛騨温泉郷・岐阜市長良川）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/mie-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【三重県】【2026年最新】三重おすすめホテル・温泉旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">三重県全域（伊勢神宮・二見浦・鳥羽温泉郷・志摩賢島・湯の山温泉・ナガシマ）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/kyoto-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【京都府】【2026年最新】京都おすすめホテル・高級旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">京都府全域（京都駅前・祇園東山・嵐山嵯峨野・海の京都天橋立）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center border-t border-amber-200/60 mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n    <a href=\"/prefectures/features\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-900 underline\">\n      🎌 全47都道府県の厳選特集一覧を見る →\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
}